1
00:00:56,312 --> 00:01:02,600
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:29,938 --> 00:01:33,080
I slept really well last night.

3
00:01:33,472 --> 00:01:35,845
These are rewards for you.

4
00:01:46,076 --> 00:01:49,223
Looks like you truly see me as...

5
00:01:57,331 --> 00:01:58,545
Well, that's fine.

6
00:01:59,091 --> 00:02:02,152
Thank you for these gifts, Your Highness.

7
00:02:08,555 --> 00:02:11,059
Please help me pawn off all of these.

8
00:02:11,282 --> 00:02:12,363
Use the money we get from them

9
00:02:12,387 --> 00:02:15,161
to set up more soup kitchens for the refugees outside the city.

10
00:02:16,074 --> 00:02:17,769
And buy some books

11
00:02:18,178 --> 00:02:20,477
and writing supplies for our fellow students.

12
00:02:21,042 --> 00:02:22,256
Where do you get them?

13
00:02:24,841 --> 00:02:26,816
Of course, the source is clean.

14
00:02:27,281 --> 00:02:30,172
Let's just call it taking from the rich to help the poor.

15
00:02:31,451 --> 00:02:32,771
But let's put that aside for now.

16
00:02:32,841 --> 00:02:33,966
Today,

17
00:02:34,249 --> 00:02:37,251
I have a "taking from the rich for the poor" plan to discuss with you.

18
00:02:38,929 --> 00:02:41,831
You just joined the Ministry of Revenue, and you're already risking it.

19
00:02:43,162 --> 00:02:45,096
The one who really gets me is you, Le Sheng.

20
00:02:45,986 --> 00:02:47,682
Now that you've landed an influential partner,

21
00:02:47,706 --> 00:02:49,360
why bother putting yourself at risk?

22
00:02:52,673 --> 00:02:54,029
All these gold and silver ingots

23
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:56,933
are really just charity from that person.

24
00:02:57,313 --> 00:03:00,513
But the only ones I can truly trust with my life are my closest friends.

25
00:03:01,226 --> 00:03:02,597
Le Sheng, you're different.

26
00:03:07,523 --> 00:03:09,600
Tell me. What's the plan?

27
00:03:11,769 --> 00:03:14,609
- You want to investigate the Crown Prince's private treasury? - Yes.

28
00:03:14,642 --> 00:03:16,183
While checking the accounts,

29
00:03:16,274 --> 00:03:18,155
I found that the Crown Prince hired many refugees

30
00:03:18,179 --> 00:03:19,579
under the guise of disaster relief,

31
00:03:19,664 --> 00:03:21,190
and paid them in grains instead of money.

32
00:03:21,214 --> 00:03:23,014
That was the Crown Prince's scheme all along.

33
00:03:24,345 --> 00:03:27,200
The only way now is to follow Commander Cui's grain transport soldiers

34
00:03:27,329 --> 00:03:29,206
to locate the Crown Prince's private treasury.

35
00:03:29,345 --> 00:03:30,582
That's the only solution.

36
00:03:30,673 --> 00:03:32,567
- Stay alert. - Yes, Commander.

37
00:03:32,889 --> 00:03:35,223
But even if you find the private treasury,

38
00:03:35,388 --> 00:03:36,922
how can you prove

39
00:03:37,179 --> 00:03:39,460
that the grains inside belong to the Ministry of Revenue?

40
00:03:39,751 --> 00:03:40,868
Don't worry, Your Highness.

41
00:03:40,949 --> 00:03:42,869
In the latest batch of grains for canal repairs,

42
00:03:43,002 --> 00:03:44,880
I mixed in special rice bran as a marker.

43
00:03:45,067 --> 00:03:46,856
When it enters the Crown Prince's private treasury,

44
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:48,597
I'll definitely be able to trace it.

45
00:03:48,808 --> 00:03:51,960
- How dare you... - I know this is risky.

46
00:03:52,361 --> 00:03:54,953
But for the sake of the country and to ease His Majesty's burdens,

47
00:03:54,977 --> 00:03:56,232
my own safety

48
00:03:56,674 --> 00:03:58,008
isn't worth mentioning.

49
00:03:58,371 --> 00:04:00,793
I promise that this action of mine

50
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:04,135
will never implicate the Ministry of Revenue or Your Highness.

51
00:04:07,170 --> 00:04:09,874
You're truly a loyal and brave Top Scholar Shen.

52
00:04:10,088 --> 00:04:11,946
I really didn't misjudge you.

53
00:04:12,305 --> 00:04:13,865
Go ahead and investigate without worry.

54
00:04:14,545 --> 00:04:15,840
If you need anything,

55
00:04:16,337 --> 00:04:18,152
I'll fully support you.

56
00:04:19,003 --> 00:04:20,217
Thank you, Your Highness.

57
00:04:21,306 --> 00:04:23,479
(Since you want to take that risk yourself, )

58
00:04:23,649 --> 00:04:25,663
(don't blame me for it.)

59
00:04:41,146 --> 00:04:43,280
Your Majesty, your medicine is here.

60
00:04:48,712 --> 00:04:51,727
Princess Zhao Yang requests an audience with His Majesty!

61
00:04:59,155 --> 00:05:01,705
I, Zhao Yang, your daughter, wish Your Majesty good health.

62
00:05:10,747 --> 00:05:13,201
I am not well.

63
00:05:16,211 --> 00:05:17,425
I'm deeply troubled by that.

64
00:05:18,146 --> 00:05:19,480
Troubled?

65
00:05:20,279 --> 00:05:24,093
You look obedient on the surface.

66
00:05:24,578 --> 00:05:27,192
But your hand has reached all the way

67
00:05:27,346 --> 00:05:30,125
toward the top scholar from humble origins whom I've chosen.

68
00:05:32,729 --> 00:05:35,840
I started the imperial exam and promoted those from humble backgrounds

69
00:05:35,953 --> 00:05:38,087
to bring new blood to the court.

70
00:05:38,305 --> 00:05:40,399
Not to send them to their deaths.

71
00:05:41,296 --> 00:05:43,550
You pushed Shen Xiao into the Ministry of Revenue.

72
00:05:44,586 --> 00:05:46,040
What are you trying to do?

73
00:05:51,490 --> 00:05:52,661
Father.

74
00:05:53,075 --> 00:05:55,750
The noble families are taking advantage of the disaster to hoard goods,

75
00:05:55,774 --> 00:05:57,215
profiting off the country's misfortune.

76
00:05:57,239 --> 00:05:59,106
The Crown Prince is misled by the noble families,

77
00:05:59,130 --> 00:06:01,103
and doesn't understand your good intentions.

78
00:06:01,455 --> 00:06:03,096
With guidance from you,

79
00:06:03,242 --> 00:06:05,200
I know I should help the Crown Prince plan more.

80
00:06:05,443 --> 00:06:07,018
The drought is severe now,

81
00:06:07,434 --> 00:06:08,808
and the people are restless.

82
00:06:08,994 --> 00:06:10,750
I hope to use Shen Xiao's abilities

83
00:06:10,857 --> 00:06:13,640
to recover the treasury for the court and bring peace to the nation.

84
00:06:14,226 --> 00:06:17,308
I also hope the Crown Prince can discern people's true character

85
00:06:17,451 --> 00:06:19,464
and understand your good intentions.

86
00:06:22,913 --> 00:06:25,991
So, you still remember.

87
00:06:28,210 --> 00:06:29,625
I wouldn't dare forget.

88
00:06:33,513 --> 00:06:35,200
The sky was glowing with rosy clouds,

89
00:06:35,281 --> 00:06:36,896
and golden light filled the heavens.

90
00:06:37,593 --> 00:06:39,031
The people are full of complaints

91
00:06:39,146 --> 00:06:41,240
after I started those massive construction projects.

92
00:06:41,346 --> 00:06:43,943
These auspicious signs you used from the heavens

93
00:06:44,106 --> 00:06:45,719
came at just the right time.

94
00:06:46,954 --> 00:06:48,728
What reward do you want?

95
00:06:49,474 --> 00:06:51,087
I don't wish for any reward.

96
00:06:51,664 --> 00:06:53,438
I only wish to ease your burdens.

97
00:06:54,217 --> 00:06:55,431
Speak.

98
00:06:57,435 --> 00:06:59,716
While I was overseeing the construction of Qianfo Temple,

99
00:07:00,248 --> 00:07:01,920
I happened to intercept a memorial from the clerk

100
00:07:01,944 --> 00:07:03,624
of the Ministry of Revenue, Shen Qing Zhi.

101
00:07:04,410 --> 00:07:07,370
It was filled with slander and false accusations against the Crown Prince.

102
00:07:07,722 --> 00:07:09,960
I was shocked and burned it right away.

103
00:07:10,863 --> 00:07:13,972
But unexpectedly, this person recently fell off a cliff.

104
00:07:14,105 --> 00:07:15,879
I'm afraid there's more to this story.

105
00:07:16,034 --> 00:07:18,151
If someone with an agenda uses it,

106
00:07:18,253 --> 00:07:20,306
it could damage the court's reputation.

107
00:07:22,777 --> 00:07:24,311
A lowly official

108
00:07:24,537 --> 00:07:26,272
trying to frame the Crown Prince

109
00:07:26,578 --> 00:07:28,400
is not worth pitying.

110
00:07:28,765 --> 00:07:31,206
Zhao Yang, you did the right thing.

111
00:07:38,938 --> 00:07:40,152
You're even

112
00:07:40,722 --> 00:07:42,256
smarter than I thought.

113
00:07:42,562 --> 00:07:43,878
The Crown Prince

114
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,705
needs someone as wise as you and knows what's important by his side.

115
00:07:47,810 --> 00:07:48,928
From now on,

116
00:07:49,019 --> 00:07:52,456
you must advise and support the Crown Prince more.

117
00:07:52,572 --> 00:07:53,865
I hope

118
00:07:54,335 --> 00:07:55,652
you will always use

119
00:07:55,761 --> 00:07:58,495
your cleverness in the right place.

120
00:07:59,649 --> 00:08:02,400
Yes, Father. I won't let you down.

121
00:08:04,265 --> 00:08:06,385
(The Crown Prince treats lives like they're nothing.)

122
00:08:06,529 --> 00:08:08,583
(He's not fit to be the future heir.)

123
00:08:08,780 --> 00:08:10,554
(If we really want to replace him, )

124
00:08:10,778 --> 00:08:13,632
(His Majesty needs to catch him making an even bigger mistake.)

125
00:08:13,987 --> 00:08:16,640
(This isn't something a righteous little official)

126
00:08:16,762 --> 00:08:18,927
(can pull off with a few impeachment letters.)

127
00:08:19,082 --> 00:08:20,496
(You have to make His Majesty)

128
00:08:20,635 --> 00:08:22,249
(unable to tolerate him anymore.)

129
00:08:22,890 --> 00:08:27,492
Even if it's for the Crown Prince and the country,

130
00:08:28,112 --> 00:08:29,887
letting Shen Xiao investigate

131
00:08:30,257 --> 00:08:32,047
is still way too risky.

132
00:08:32,352 --> 00:08:35,660
I can allow him to try.

133
00:08:37,042 --> 00:08:38,097
But

134
00:08:38,642 --> 00:08:41,417
you need to support him from the sidelines.

135
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,494
I will keep Shen Xiao safe.

136
00:08:55,530 --> 00:08:56,864
I'll take my leave.

137
00:08:58,453 --> 00:08:59,667
(Shen Xiao.)

138
00:08:59,803 --> 00:09:02,753
(It's confirmed that the noble families are manipulating the Crown Prince.)

139
00:09:02,777 --> 00:09:04,094
(If you die, )

140
00:09:04,175 --> 00:09:06,907
(it'll completely turn the Crown Prince against the Emperor.)

141
00:09:07,107 --> 00:09:09,703
(Whether you solve the Yongtong Canal issue or not, )

142
00:09:09,785 --> 00:09:12,879
(you'll still help weaken the noble families.)

143
00:09:15,658 --> 00:09:17,720
(Wannian Granary)

144
00:09:29,905 --> 00:09:31,597
- Stay alert. - Roger that.

145
00:10:19,553 --> 00:10:20,706
(This is not right.)

146
00:10:21,775 --> 00:10:23,815
(These aren't grains from the Ministry of Revenue.)

147
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,600
Aren't you Censor Shen?

148
00:10:47,002 --> 00:10:48,816
You sneaked into the Princess's granary.

149
00:10:49,033 --> 00:10:52,015
What secrets are you trying to find in these rice sacks?

150
00:11:00,409 --> 00:11:02,635
I've really underestimated you, Top Scholar.

151
00:11:02,765 --> 00:11:04,844
Since you won't show your true face,

152
00:11:04,935 --> 00:11:06,840
don't blame us if you get hurt.

153
00:11:32,284 --> 00:11:34,071
- Commander is hurt. - Stop him!

154
00:11:34,161 --> 00:11:35,672
Commander, are you okay?

155
00:12:34,482 --> 00:12:36,520
- Go after him! - Roger that!

156
00:12:37,265 --> 00:12:39,791
I didn't expect you could ride so well.

157
00:12:39,994 --> 00:12:42,674
I didn't expect you could actually injure Prince Consort Cui.

158
00:12:55,232 --> 00:12:56,446
Stop right there!

159
00:13:02,281 --> 00:13:03,495
Get off your horse.

160
00:13:09,953 --> 00:13:11,167
Wait up for me!

161
00:13:11,906 --> 00:13:13,120
Turn around.

162
00:13:26,233 --> 00:13:28,768
Commander Cui, long time no see. Hope you've been well.

163
00:13:32,050 --> 00:13:34,410
This is the Map Commissioner Badge bestowed by His Majesty.

164
00:13:35,426 --> 00:13:37,000
Map Commissioner?

165
00:13:38,065 --> 00:13:40,120
Are you the Seventh Prince?

166
00:13:42,321 --> 00:13:43,696
I, Cui Jin Zhi,

167
00:13:44,737 --> 00:13:46,057
pay my respects to Your Highness.

168
00:13:47,795 --> 00:13:49,064
It's been a long time.

169
00:13:49,770 --> 00:13:52,744
Your Highness, what brings you to the wilderness so late at night?

170
00:13:54,329 --> 00:13:57,080
I'm observing the stars tonight to map the land.

171
00:13:58,289 --> 00:14:00,184
Commander Cui, who are you chasing after

172
00:14:00,461 --> 00:14:02,208
so late at night with your troops?

173
00:14:02,289 --> 00:14:04,287
I'm after a wanted criminal.

174
00:14:04,410 --> 00:14:07,284
Have you seen anyone suspicious around?

175
00:14:07,481 --> 00:14:08,775
I haven't seen anyone.

176
00:14:14,877 --> 00:14:16,944
Commander Cui, are you suspecting me?

177
00:14:18,651 --> 00:14:19,865
I wouldn't dare.

178
00:14:20,121 --> 00:14:21,415
If you wouldn't dare,

179
00:14:22,145 --> 00:14:23,843
then stop following me.

180
00:14:39,205 --> 00:14:40,245
Commander.

181
00:14:40,327 --> 00:14:43,527
How come I've never heard of the Seventh Prince?

182
00:14:44,304 --> 00:14:45,662
He was born with white hair.

183
00:14:45,786 --> 00:14:47,352
So he was seen as a bad omen.

184
00:14:47,835 --> 00:14:49,546
He was ordered to leave the palace seven years ago.

185
00:14:49,570 --> 00:14:51,600
Why would he be back right this moment?

186
00:14:51,755 --> 00:14:53,849
And just when Shen Xiao escaped.

187
00:14:55,539 --> 00:14:56,846
There's something off about him.

188
00:14:57,044 --> 00:14:58,458
Have someone follow him in secret.

189
00:14:58,697 --> 00:15:01,238
Find out where he lives and who he's meeting with. Go.

190
00:15:01,329 --> 00:15:02,543
Yes, Commander.

191
00:15:05,731 --> 00:15:07,208
The one who saved Shen Xiao

192
00:15:07,338 --> 00:15:09,111
must be a woman.

193
00:15:13,506 --> 00:15:16,040
(Princess Zhao Yang Residence)

194
00:15:23,522 --> 00:15:25,202
You really think Cui Jin Zhi is that dumb?

195
00:15:25,259 --> 00:15:27,484
Do you know whose private treasury you broke into tonight?

196
00:15:27,508 --> 00:15:28,722
It's mine.

197
00:15:30,050 --> 00:15:31,330
How can you laugh about that?

198
00:15:31,449 --> 00:15:32,969
Didn't you say you didn't want to die?

199
00:15:34,538 --> 00:15:36,298
You said you wouldn't care about me anymore.

200
00:15:38,233 --> 00:15:40,353
So why risk your life to save me today?

201
00:15:41,611 --> 00:15:43,131
His Majesty ordered me to protect you.

202
00:15:47,032 --> 00:15:48,505
If you hadn't received an imperial order,

203
00:15:48,529 --> 00:15:50,743
would you really let me die?

204
00:15:53,937 --> 00:15:55,311
Don't be mad, Your Highness.

205
00:15:55,402 --> 00:15:56,791
I was reckless today.

206
00:15:57,193 --> 00:15:58,950
That was why I fell into their trap.

207
00:15:59,050 --> 00:16:00,825
I should've been more careful.

208
00:16:01,761 --> 00:16:03,615
What's the point of saying that now?

209
00:16:05,562 --> 00:16:07,730
What's wrong? Let me see.

210
00:16:12,793 --> 00:16:14,767
So, you do worry about me after all.

211
00:16:21,257 --> 00:16:22,672
I'm not wasting my time on you.

212
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:34,567
You idiot! I'm the Prince Consort.

213
00:16:34,658 --> 00:16:36,872
Do you think the Princess's chamber can keep me out?

214
00:16:37,922 --> 00:16:39,136
Move aside.

215
00:16:43,530 --> 00:16:44,744
Hurry up and hide inside.

216
00:16:52,666 --> 00:16:54,041
Who's inside?

217
00:16:55,385 --> 00:16:57,119
What are you doing? Get in there!

218
00:16:58,186 --> 00:16:59,560
Get in there now.

219
00:17:09,242 --> 00:17:11,498
Zhao Yang! Who's in the chamber?

220
00:17:11,729 --> 00:17:13,423
Prince Consort, you can't go in!

221
00:17:15,359 --> 00:17:16,573
Zhao Yang!

222
00:17:37,665 --> 00:17:39,238
Seems like you've forgotten

223
00:17:39,458 --> 00:17:41,075
about my rules.

224
00:17:41,518 --> 00:17:43,480
How dare you barge into my residence at night?

225
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:48,675
Someone broke into your granary tonight.

226
00:17:48,826 --> 00:17:50,199
For your safety,

227
00:17:50,442 --> 00:17:52,155
I have to check things out.

228
00:17:54,111 --> 00:17:56,120
You have your men guarding the granary.

229
00:17:56,226 --> 00:17:58,266
But someone still managed to slip in and out of it?

230
00:17:58,513 --> 00:18:00,273
Looks like this person is no ordinary thief.

231
00:18:00,307 --> 00:18:01,880
Just some petty crook.

232
00:18:02,354 --> 00:18:03,631
If I catch him,

233
00:18:03,737 --> 00:18:05,731
I'll tear him to pieces.

234
00:18:20,587 --> 00:18:21,760
Are you hurt?

235
00:18:24,369 --> 00:18:27,191
The one who hurt me was probably Shen Xiao.

236
00:18:38,786 --> 00:18:40,679
You never sleep in your outer robe.

237
00:18:41,297 --> 00:18:43,698
Did you go out tonight?

238
00:18:45,098 --> 00:18:47,312
You have never stayed overnight at my residence.

239
00:18:47,403 --> 00:18:48,963
You sound like you know me pretty well.

240
00:18:49,034 --> 00:18:50,293
The person who saved Shen Xiao

241
00:18:50,756 --> 00:18:51,970
was you.

242
00:18:55,731 --> 00:18:57,809
Prince Consort, are you out of your mind?

243
00:18:58,337 --> 00:18:59,851
If I were helping Shen Xiao,

244
00:19:00,194 --> 00:19:03,014
I wouldn't be so dumb as to send him to the heavily guarded granary

245
00:19:03,105 --> 00:19:04,556
and then save him myself.

246
00:19:04,851 --> 00:19:06,225
Prince Consort, this accusation

247
00:19:06,611 --> 00:19:08,073
isn't very clever.

248
00:19:11,785 --> 00:19:13,920
You're always suspicious of me and Shen Xiao.

249
00:19:14,476 --> 00:19:15,954
Do you want me to get caught

250
00:19:16,035 --> 00:19:18,551
so you can make room for your new mistress?

251
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:20,185
I don't have a mistress anymore.

252
00:19:20,317 --> 00:19:22,805
I've already sent Qing Luo away. There won't be anyone else!

253
00:19:24,378 --> 00:19:25,480
Forget it.

254
00:19:26,628 --> 00:19:29,703
I'm pretty sure the person who saved Shen Xiao was a woman.

255
00:19:30,098 --> 00:19:31,953
She looked a lot like you.

256
00:19:34,571 --> 00:19:36,985
Prince Consort, you can't even remember what I look like?

257
00:19:37,242 --> 00:19:38,815
I'm not joking with you.

258
00:19:38,914 --> 00:19:40,850
The Crown Prince hates Shen Xiao most of all.

259
00:19:41,383 --> 00:19:44,772
- If you keep... - Was it really Shen Xiao who hurt you?

260
00:19:45,698 --> 00:19:47,604
Then he's actually quite capable.

261
00:19:48,291 --> 00:19:49,505
Li Shu.

262
00:19:52,938 --> 00:19:55,106
If I didn't know you hated me,

263
00:19:56,307 --> 00:19:57,820
I would've thought

264
00:19:58,109 --> 00:20:00,192
that you were just jealous.

265
00:20:03,513 --> 00:20:04,888
You're hurt too.

266
00:20:05,009 --> 00:20:06,223
You should head back and rest.

267
00:20:09,346 --> 00:20:10,626
I'm hurt.

268
00:20:11,634 --> 00:20:13,434
Are you not going to take care of me anymore?

269
00:20:14,193 --> 00:20:15,407
In the past...

270
00:20:19,078 --> 00:20:21,666
In the past, you used to help me apply medicine on my wounds.

271
00:20:24,306 --> 00:20:25,727
That was in the past.

272
00:20:25,890 --> 00:20:28,007
Back then, I wanted to get close to you.

273
00:20:28,231 --> 00:20:30,886
That's why I waited outside the Cold Palace every day to bandage you.

274
00:20:30,910 --> 00:20:34,111
That way, I would have a chance to sit in on the Grand Tutor's lessons.

275
00:20:34,282 --> 00:20:37,256
I won the Crown Prince's favor by ghostwriting for him.

276
00:20:37,803 --> 00:20:40,084
I was just waiting for a chance to leave the Cold Palace.

277
00:20:40,625 --> 00:20:41,742
No.

278
00:20:42,202 --> 00:20:43,416
Impossible.

279
00:20:55,244 --> 00:20:56,562
It was just sparring.

280
00:20:56,643 --> 00:20:58,994
How could the Crown Prince go so hard on you?

281
00:20:59,537 --> 00:21:00,751
I'm fine.

282
00:21:01,350 --> 00:21:03,733
His Highness is my lord, I'm his subject.

283
00:21:03,824 --> 00:21:05,734
A subject can't blame their lord.

284
00:21:06,225 --> 00:21:08,250
In the end, whether it's punishment or reward,

285
00:21:08,481 --> 00:21:09,695
it's all the lord's grace.

286
00:21:10,667 --> 00:21:12,081
Those of us close to him

287
00:21:12,201 --> 00:21:14,135
are no different from his hounds or hawks.

288
00:21:14,374 --> 00:21:15,747
As long as the master is happy,

289
00:21:15,828 --> 00:21:17,305
that's all that matters to us.

290
00:21:17,394 --> 00:21:19,188
- That's not right. - Why is it not right?

291
00:21:19,736 --> 00:21:20,854
A ruler

292
00:21:20,950 --> 00:21:23,924
should lead with virtue and win people over with kindness.

293
00:21:24,283 --> 00:21:25,817
Even the Crown Prince

294
00:21:26,371 --> 00:21:28,624
shouldn't take pleasure in humiliating others.

295
00:21:29,298 --> 00:21:30,832
And he shouldn't look down on

296
00:21:31,305 --> 00:21:33,279
those who serve him loyally.

297
00:21:38,122 --> 00:21:40,015
You may be the Crown Prince's study companion,

298
00:21:40,401 --> 00:21:41,974
but you're still your own person.

299
00:21:48,785 --> 00:21:49,999
Li Shu.

300
00:21:50,737 --> 00:21:52,711
Once I earn some military merit next year,

301
00:21:53,969 --> 00:21:55,569
I'll go and beg His Majesty for a favor.

302
00:22:02,987 --> 00:22:05,680
When that time comes, no one will be able to bully you.

303
00:22:05,778 --> 00:22:07,591
Not even the Crown Prince.

304
00:22:16,067 --> 00:22:17,440
The battlefield is dangerous.

305
00:22:17,577 --> 00:22:18,950
You have to be careful.

306
00:22:19,938 --> 00:22:21,015
For you,

307
00:22:21,129 --> 00:22:22,795
I promise I'll come back safe.

308
00:22:35,506 --> 00:22:36,822
We weren't like this

309
00:22:38,026 --> 00:22:39,242
in the past.

310
00:22:42,282 --> 00:22:44,096
You must have remembered it wrongly.

311
00:22:44,538 --> 00:22:46,569
I'm just a scheming,

312
00:22:46,930 --> 00:22:49,703
lowly orphan who crawled out of the Cold Palace.

313
00:22:51,721 --> 00:22:53,239
Who do you think you are?

314
00:22:53,337 --> 00:22:56,935
Aren't you just a lowly orphan who crawled out of the Cold Palace?

315
00:23:00,529 --> 00:23:02,584
- I... - On our wedding night,

316
00:23:02,953 --> 00:23:04,754
you made that very clear.

317
00:23:15,347 --> 00:23:18,136
How did it come to this between us?

318
00:23:20,447 --> 00:23:21,701
Let go of me!

319
00:23:23,474 --> 00:23:24,635
Let go!
